# Web

# Firebase CLIENT config (project id / API key / sender id) is COMMITTED — not a
# secret; it ships in every distributed app and lets the build work on any
# machine: lib/firebase_options.dart, android/app/google-services.json,
# ios/Runner/GoogleService-Info.plist. The spine FCM SERVICE-ACCOUNT JSON
# (private key) is the real secret and stays out of git (spine/.env, gitignored).

# Exceptions to above rules.
!/packages/flutter_tools/test/data/dart_dependencies_test/**/.packages
